{"id":"C025b590e5491e72bc214","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"随机分析","definition_zh":"受随机激励或随机系统参数影响的振动。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":"random analysis 与 stochastic analysis 在所引文献中并用，不能据此将所有含 random 与 stochastic 的方法名称视为同义。","scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C025b590e5491e72bc214","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"随机分析","group_id":"Hf4cac7d2d942b3586897","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"随机分析 · Xu等（2019）"},{"id":"C54cc2cf66931772b6b52","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"Hf4cac7d2d942b3586897","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"},{"id":"C7092d6cf2b5f1ad6d43f","zh":"随机振动","en":"random vibration","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","group_id":"Hf4cac7d2d942b3586897","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Dbe65561b74e01e8e2668","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"随机振动"},{"id":"D78a704d2e89cc0de9cea","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"random vibration"},{"id":"D1a60aa5bbf5ec4e07206","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"stochastic vibration"},{"id":"D3c1b582e6bb3389ee976","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"复数 vibrations"}],"sources":{"P011":{"id":"P011","title":"A model for vehicle–track random interactions on effects of crosswinds and track irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1469775","journal_citation":"Vehicle system dynamics 57 (3), 444-469","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-model-for-vehicle-track-random-interactions-on-effects-of-crosswinds-and-track-irregularities"},"P113":{"id":"P113","title":"车辆-轨道系统时-空随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.01.012","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-stochastic-model-used-for-temporal-spatial-analysis-of-vehicle-track-coupled-systems"},"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3608206496c974f13d4f","source_id":"P011","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"en","text":"From afore-mentioned researches, it can be seen that the findings on wind-induced vehicle vibrations are abundant, which have provided sufficient and meaningful approaches to further reveal the random vibration characteristics of railway vehicles in stochastic wind environment.","citations":[{"source_id":"P011","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S2bf7aec5cbfaac25cbc8","source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"最后,采用该模型分析了不同变异系数下的车辆-轨道系统时-空随机振动,分析中假定系统动力参数服从正态分布,并基于实测数据进行轨道不平顺的时-空随机模拟。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S75266a57733cbcbbca08","source_id":"P113","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"通过对既有研究的总结可知,目前关于车线(桥) 系统随机性的研究取得了不少成果,但考虑系统时-空随机动力效应的车辆-轨道系统时-空随机振动模型尚未完整建立,主要原因有: (1)车辆、轨道系统动力参数随时间维度的演化特性未知。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S90d5607214c10aaaeb09","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"车辆-轨道系统的随机振动特性主要来源于激振源和系统参数的随机性,考虑到车辆-轨道系统理论计算条件与实际物理、力学状态间的差异,以及常规计算中激振源和车线参数的不完备性与时效不变性,亟待开展车辆-轨道系统的随机分析 [1-6]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Cc89b37e95c5dee320eef","target_concept_id":"Cc89b37e95c5dee320eef","target_zh":"变异系数","target_en":"coefficients of variation","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C7adf010816ec2b5ee567","target_concept_id":"C7adf010816ec2b5ee567","target_zh":"随机模拟","target_en":"stochastic simulation","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Ca0a49b8a6f951c5891ee","target_concept_id":"Ca0a49b8a6f951c5891ee","target_zh":"正态分布","target_en":"normal distribution","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C7f6fd21d0555aeda6e3c","target_concept_id":"C7f6fd21d0555aeda6e3c","target_zh":"随机分析","target_en":"stochastic analysis","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P113","title":"车辆-轨道系统时-空随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.01.012","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-stochastic-model-used-for-temporal-spatial-analysis-of-vehicle-track-coupled-systems"},{"id":"P011","title":"A model for vehicle–track random interactions on effects of crosswinds and track irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1469775","journal_citation":"Vehicle system dynamics 57 (3), 444-469","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-model-for-vehicle-track-random-interactions-on-effects-of-crosswinds-and-track-irregularities"},{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}]}